2 CONT Alessandro married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34720849764 Leopolda Incisa della Rocchetta]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34720849788 Alfonso Casati]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on June 4, 1955. 
